    // dp-scaled (density=1 on this runtime → dp(x)==x). Margins always dp.
    // Gravity bits (AOSP Gravity): LEFT=3, CENTER_HORIZONTAL=1, RIGHT=5,
    // TOP=0x30, CENTER_VERTICAL=0x10, BOTTOM=0x50, CENTER=0x11.
