        // Two HEAP-BACKED java.lang.Class tokens (OBJECT_REF×OBJECT_REF,
        // runtime class Ljava/lang/Class;) previously fell out of this
        // branch entirely (not app-DEX, not base-Object, not CLASS_REF
        // register-form) and reached NO equals handler at all → the
        // dispatch answered fail-soft false. Live root: Thunderbird v24
        // Koin — ClassReference.equals → Object.equals(jClass, jClass)
        // on two distinct heap tokens for the same referent → false →
        // the CHM collision-chain compare died → NoDefinitionFound×32.
